<title>SWITZERLAND: SOCCER-SEMIFINAL DRAW FOR EUROPEAN CLUB COMPETITIONS.</title>
<headline>SOCCER-SEMIFINAL DRAW FOR EUROPEAN CLUB COMPETITIONS.</headline>
<dateline>LAUSANNE, Switzerland 1997-03-21</dateline>
<text>
<p>The draw for the semifinals of the three European club soccer competitions was made on Friday as follows:</p>
<p>European Cup Borussia Dortmund (Germany) v Manchester United (England) Ajax Amsterdam (Netherlands) v Juventus (Italy)</p>
<p>First legs April 9, return legs April 23</p>
<p>UEFA Cup Tenerife(Spain) v Schalke (Germany) Inter Milan (Italy) v Monaco (France)</p>
<p>First legs April 8, return legs April 22</p>
<p>Winner of the Tenerife v Schalke match will host first leg of the final.</p>
<p>Cup Winners' Cup Barcelona (Spain) v Fiorentina (Italy) Paris St Germain (France) v Liverpool (England)</p>
<p>First legs April 10, return legs April 24</p>
